  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p>An Ion Rifle is simply a larger version of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ion_Pistol\" title=\"Ion Pistol\">Ion Pistol</a>. An Ion Rifle fires a stream of energy that wreaks havoc on electrical systems, making it effective against&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Droids\" title=\"Droids\">Droids</a>,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Vehicles\" title=\"Vehicles\">Vehicles</a>, electronic devices, and cybernetically enhanced creatures. </p><p>It deals full damage against such targets, and has a chance of pushing its target down the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Condition_Track\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Condition Track\">Condition Track</a>. Creatures without cybernetics take half damage from a successful attack, and suffer no other ill effects. </p><p>An Ion Rifle requires a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a> to operate. After 20 shots, the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Power_Pack\" title=\"Power Pack\">Power Pack</a> must be replaced. </p>",
